e not deceived about Allāh by the Deceiver [i.e., Satan].","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"31:34","t":"Indeed, Allāh [alone] has knowledge of the Hour and sends down the rain and knows what is in the wombs. And no soul perceives what it will earn tomorrow, and no soul perceives in what land it will die. Indeed, Allāh is Knowing and Aware.","j":21,"h":42,"s":31,"a":34,"sd":null}],"juz":21,"hizb":42,"surahs":[31],"sajdah":false}